  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-no-touch-fish-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "39e7993baf222d8af00892f26d1a4a4f6c4675622888560c4700fbca703b2d80",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "826361fc5978548907707aabe71557408a6b6b28789d672b471fe6fa5bad59ef",
      "text": "悟空的\n隔空小鱼",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a60a37d0c2a54c0410dd28981f6e883bc44a23a96cb5be53e83c3f7f9949eb2",
      "text": "沙僧带来一个游戏，\n摆在铁扇公主的院子里。\n纸做的小河上，架着一座纸桥，\n河里有一条红色的纸鱼。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16a5d612081f420efe9825284ac31e44b601d146a45cde65e8a2d667675fb4e3",
      "text": "悟空凑近一看：\n小鱼自己动了！谁也没碰它。\n它朝着小桥游过去。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "36bf73e73bc6228d981ea9d16512c3a78b04476966e1571dee384046e4942d0e",
      "text": "悟空喊：“铁扇公主！\n是你用扇子扇的吧！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2500fa1bb2b699302d7c03be06c1bc91b0a74e37f12403c3d861bfb4d4ee60a2",
      "text": "铁扇公主举起扇子：\n扇子一动也没动。\n可小鱼还是游到了桥底下！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c6b1884deef3dbbf8ccf594985fe2d86bd10475c091ea70f4814b619e721389",
      "text": "沙僧哈哈一笑，\n把手从纸板底下伸出来。\n他手里拿着一根磁棒！\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "17baa2583d4f0ce73132cd127659cca72a245491fee68a99caac6e4a0e622731",
      "text": "悟空问：“磁铁能吸住纸吗？”\n沙僧说：“找几样材料试一试。”\n木块、塑料片、铝片，还\n有钢片。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "284300d3e845fc9cb887de9ff3a11c80b4496c370c87bf9757d5d6349e1b7b62",
      "text": "磁棒碰碰木块——没反应。\n碰碰塑料片——还是没反应。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff6bbd38bd632b8c648fa9db0e9fcdfbeda4345bf1dddf9b48f66e4842e2b72f",
      "text": "铁扇公主拿亮闪闪的铝片来试：\n“这是金属，一定能吸住！”\n可是没吸住。\n不是所有金属都能被磁铁吸住。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a74ae122f701da1c275a42f27aaf7105929f4a4df6612a1c91977a49cbb10e13",
      "text": "最后试钢片。\n“啪！”钢片一下子跳到磁棒上。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e494bfbf4eb01d7e701d3e7967ce9e047a56d91b6f8b66e728857215176fc59c",
      "text": "悟空问：“小鱼肚子里有钢片吗？”\n沙僧打开小鱼肚子上的小口\n袋——\n真的有一小块钢片！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae2c5f76486d262f824430d85e02e16112cd2a9544f5a2643691e8108bfead47",
      "text": "沙僧在纸板底下移动磁棒。\n隔着纸板，磁铁也能拉着\n钢片走，\n所以小鱼就游起来啦！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f06f01b1a4ca8d9698be2ca1555ba0a65ea014cb4323f2caff4a114b3c7662ed",
      "text": "悟空自己剪了一条纸鱼，\n也在纸板底下移动磁棒。\n可他的小鱼一动也不动。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bca4880beb151fc9c49fdf89d8f3585ed4d8e69b65beead7d2555360d92edafc",
      "text": "悟空客客气气地说：“请你\n游一下？”\n小鱼还是不动。\n铁扇公主躲在扇子后面偷偷笑。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ffd04139cf79c7149f38209acb251568b3a29ecb8c1cb000f0190501983e962d",
      "text": "铁扇公主把那块钢片递给他，\n两人把钢片贴进小鱼肚子里。\n这下悟空的小鱼也会游了！\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98a8ab0e34c0b2eb39f81fab68511f1fe170e1202d4e2a41ac661504d0a338e0",
      "text": "两条小鱼一条接一条，钻\n过纸桥，\n一直游进了纸池塘。\n悟空说：“谢谢你，磁铁！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
